description	"GenoHaradan Agent

Elite covert agents utilizing subtle influence to shift the battlefield.

^8Attributes:
- Reinforcement (1)
- Sense Immunity
- Dexterity (2)
- Knockdown Roll
- Anti Mind Trick (2)
- Dodge (3)
- Tracking Beacon

^3Abilities:
- Flipkick (1) ^3[Contact Jump]
- Grapple Hook ^3[Melee CS4]
- Dodge (3) ^3[CS1]"
